This project builds on slurm-docker-cluster by Giovanni Torres and
contributors, which provides the containerised Slurm control plane the
benchmark injects faults into.

    https://github.com/giovtorres/slurm-docker-cluster
    Licensed under the MIT License.
    Pinned at commit 978c3ded1f72c1855e528a56559a7a51142eb39c (Slurm 25.11.4).

That project's source is NOT vendored into this repository. `make cluster`
clones it at the pinned commit into vendor/, which is gitignored. The compose
file under cluster/ is a derived, reduced configuration written for this
benchmark; the images it references are built from the upstream Dockerfile.

All benchmark scenarios, ground truth, harness code, and scoring logic in this
repository are original work.
